        "## 3. Analysis 1: Top 10 Vendors by Volume\n",
        "\n",
        "Identifying top vendors by procurement volume (Order Quantity) is crucial for understanding supplier reliance and negotiating better terms. This analysis aggregates the total order quantity for each supplier and then ranks them."
      ]
    },
