        "## 6. Key Procurement Metrics Calculation\n",
        "\n",
        "This section calculates several important metrics to provide a high-level overview of the procurement activities. These metrics include total spend, total number of purchase orders, total unique vendors, average purchase order value, and average line-item value."
      ]
