        "## 7. Analysis 4: Pareto Analysis of Vendors by PO Value\n",
        "\n",
        "Pareto analysis, also known as the 80/20 rule, helps identify the vital few vendors that account for the majority of the total procurement spend. This analysis involves calculating each vendor's total spend, sorting them, and then determining the cumulative spend percentage to find the vendors making up approximately 80% of the total PO value."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 1000
        },
        "id": "3d97f2e6",
        "outputId": "991bc49c-c566-4dae-dce6-b84fe289bdeb"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Calculate total spend for each vendor\n",
        "vendor_spend = df.groupby('Vendor')['PO Value (PKR)'].sum().reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Sort vendors by total spend in descending order\n",
        "vendor_spend = vendor_spend.sort_values(by='PO Value (PKR)', ascending=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the total sum of all PO values\n",
        "total_spend = vendor_spend['PO Value (PKR)'].sum()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the percentage of total spend for each vendor\n",
        "vendor_spend['Percentage of Total Spend'] = (vendor_spend['PO Value (PKR)'] / total_spend) * 100\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the cumulative percentage of spend\n",
        "vendor_spend['Cumulative Percentage'] = vendor_spend['Percentage of Total Spend'].cumsum()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Identify vendors contributing to approximately 80% of the total spend\n",
        "pareto_vendors = vendor_spend[vendor_spend['Cumulative Percentage'] <= 80]\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nPareto Analysis: Vendors contributing to approximately 80% of Total Spend:\")\n",
        "display(pareto_vendors)"
      ],
