      "source": [
        "## 8. Analysis 5: ABC Analysis of Material Groups by PO Value\n",
        "\n",
        "ABC analysis is an inventory categorization technique that divides items into three categories (A, B, and C) based on their annual consumption value. Category A items are those with the highest consumption value, B items are those with moderate value, and C items are those with the lowest value. This helps in prioritizing inventory management efforts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 620
        },
        "id": "44c668d4",
        "outputId": "a577b09d-6dca-45fb-95f3-8819ccfd46db"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Calculate total spend for each material group\n",
        "material_group_spend = df.groupby('Material Group')['PO Value (PKR)'].sum().reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Sort material groups by total spend in descending order\n",
        "material_group_spend = material_group_spend.sort_values(by='PO Value (PKR)', ascending=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the total sum of all PO values across all material groups\n",
        "total_spend_materials = material_group_spend['PO Value (PKR)'].sum()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the percentage of total spend for each material group\n",
        "material_group_spend['Percentage of Total Spend'] = (material_group_spend['PO Value (PKR)'] / total_spend_materials) * 100\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the cumulative percentage of spend\n",
        "material_group_spend['Cumulative Percentage'] = material_group_spend['Percentage of Total Spend'].cumsum()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Assign ABC categories\n",
        "def assign_abc_category(cumulative_percentage):\n",
        "    if cumulative_percentage <= 80:\n",
        "        return 'A'\n",
        "    elif cumulative_percentage <= 95:\n",
        "        return 'B'\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        return 'C'\n",
        "\n",
        "material_group_spend['ABC Category'] = material_group_spend['Cumulative Percentage'].apply(assign_abc_category)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nABC Analysis: Material Groups by PO Value (PKR):\")\n",
        "display(material_group_spend)"
      ],
