        "## 9. Analysis 6: ABC Analysis of Suppliers by PO Value\n",
        "\n",
        "Similar to ABC analysis for material groups, this technique can be applied to suppliers to categorize them based on their procurement spend value. This helps in strategic supplier management, focusing efforts on high-value suppliers (A-category) for relationship building and risk mitigation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 1000
        },
        "id": "61e48167",
        "outputId": "08229ffa-04e6-48af-a537-6fc51ba52a13"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Calculate total spend for each vendor\n",
        "supplier_spend = df.groupby('Vendor')['PO Value (PKR)'].sum().reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Filter out the 'Unknown' vendor\n",
        "supplier_spend = supplier_spend[supplier_spend['Vendor'] != 'Unknown']\n",
        "\n",
        "# Sort suppliers by total spend in descending order\n",
        "supplier_spend = supplier_spend.sort_values(by='PO Value (PKR)', ascending=False)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the total sum of all PO values across all suppliers\n",
        "total_spend_suppliers = supplier_spend['PO Value (PKR)'].sum()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the percentage of total spend for each supplier\n",
        "supplier_spend['Percentage of Total Spend'] = (supplier_spend['PO Value (PKR)'] / total_spend_suppliers) * 100\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculate the cumulative percentage of spend\n",
        "supplier_spend['Cumulative Percentage'] = supplier_spend['Percentage of Total Spend'].cumsum()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Assign ABC categories\n",
        "def assign_abc_category(cumulative_percentage):\n",
        "    if cumulative_percentage <= 80:\n",
        "        return 'A'\n",
        "    elif cumulative_percentage <= 95:\n",
        "        return 'B'\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        return 'C'\n",
        "\n",
        "supplier_spend['ABC Category'] = supplier_spend['Cumulative Percentage'].apply(assign_abc_category)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nABC Analysis: Suppliers by PO Value (PKR):\")\n",
        "display(supplier_spend)"
      ],
